{{#> layout
  title='How to Use AI as a Language Learner'
  metaDescription='Ask ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude your everyday questions in the language you are learning. Get replies plus grammar corrections. Ready-made prompt inside.'
  url='/ai.html'
  ogImage="ai.png"
  ogDescription='Turn any popular AI into your language teacher.'
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  noCta=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
}}
  <style>
    :root {
      --ai-radius: 1rem;
      --ai-padding: 1.25rem;
      --ai-surface: #fff;
      --ai-muted-surface: #f5f6f8;
      --ai-border: var(--v-color-border);
      --ai-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(var(--v-color-body-rgb), 0.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(var(--v-color-body-rgb), 0.06);
      --ai-accent: var(--v-color-primary);
      --ai-accent-soft: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.08);
    }

    /* Platform-specific content, toggled from ai.ts */
    .ai-page:not(.is-mobile) .mobile-only,
    .ai-page.is-mobile .desktop-only {
      display: none !important;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .ai-hero {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
    }

    .ai-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--ai-accent-soft);
      color: var(--ai-accent);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .ai-eyebrow img {
      width: 1rem;
      height: 1rem;
    }

    .ai-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .ai-lede {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 36rem;
    }

    .ai-hero .call-out {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }

    /* Example conversation */
    .ai-example {
      background: var(--ai-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--ai-border);
      border-radius: var(--ai-radius);
      box-shadow: var(--ai-shadow);
      padding: var(--ai-padding);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .ai-example-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--v-color-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .ai-bubble-user {
      margin-left: auto;
      max-width: 85%;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0.25rem 1rem;
      background: var(--ai-muted-surface);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .ai-bubble-ai h3 {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      word-spacing: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    }

    .ai-bubble-ai p {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .ai-bubble-ai hr {
      margin: 0.75rem 0;
      opacity: 0.1;
    }

    .ai-bubble-ai ul {
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .ai-bubble-ai li + li {
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    .ai-bubble-ai strong {
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Steps */
    .ai-setup {
      background: var(--ai-muted-surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ai-border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ai-border);
    }

    .ai-setup-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .ai-setup-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgba(var(--v-color-body-rgb), 0.65);
    }

    .ai-steps {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
      counter-reset: ai-step;
    }

    .ai-step {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 3.25rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
      counter-increment: ai-step;
    }

    .ai-step:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .ai-step::before {
      content: counter(ai-step);
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: -0.1rem;
      width: 2.1rem;
      height: 2.1rem;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--ai-accent);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .ai-step:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: calc(1.05rem - 1px);
      top: 2.4rem;
      bottom: 0.4rem;
      width: 2px;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.15);
    }

    .ai-step-title {
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding-top: 0.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .ai-card {
      background: var(--ai-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--ai-border);
      border-radius: var(--ai-radius);
      box-shadow: var(--ai-shadow);
    }

    .select-language {
      border-radius: var(--ai-radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--ai-border);
      box-shadow: var(--ai-shadow);
      padding: 0.85rem var(--ai-padding);
      background-position: right var(--ai-padding) center;
    }

    /* Prompt */
    .ai-prompt-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.6rem 0.6rem var(--ai-padding);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ai-border);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--v-color-muted);
    }

    #prompt {
      display: block;
      margin: 0;
      padding: var(--ai-padding);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
      color: var(--v-color-body);
      cursor: text;
    }

    #copy-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      border-radius: 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
    }

    #copy-button.is-copied {
      background: #198754;
      border-color: #198754;
    }

    /* AI tabs */
    #ai-tabs .ai-tabs-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      padding: 0.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-body-rgb), 0.06);
      border-radius: var(--ai-radius);
    }

    #ai-tabs .ai-tab {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--v-color-muted);
      border-radius: calc(var(--ai-radius) - 0.3rem);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }

    #ai-tabs .ai-tab:hover {
      color: var(--v-color-body);
    }

    #ai-tabs .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] {
      background: var(--ai-surface);
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(var(--v-color-body-rgb), 0.12);
    }

    #ai-tabs .ai-logo {
      width: 1.15em;
      height: 1.15em;
      opacity: 0.55;
      transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
    }

    #ai-tabs .ai-tab:hover .ai-logo,
    #ai-tabs .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] .ai-logo {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .ai-panel {
      padding: var(--ai-padding);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .ai-panel[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-panel ol {
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .ai-panel li + li {
      margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }

    .ai-panel .ai-open-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;
    }

    .ai-panel .ai-open-button img {
      width: 1.2em;
      height: 1.2em;
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
    }

    .ai-panel-note {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: rgba(var(--v-color-body-rgb), 0.65);
      margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    }

    .ai-tip {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: var(--ai-padding);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .ai-tip .bi {
      color: var(--ai-accent);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    @media (max-width: 575.98px) {
      :root {
        --ai-padding: 1rem;
      }

      .ai-hero {
        padding: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
      }

      .ai-step {
        padding-left: 0;
        padding-top: 2.75rem;
      }

      .ai-step::before {
        top: 0;
      }

      .ai-step:not(:last-child)::after {
        display: none;
      }

      .ai-prompt-header {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
        padding: 0.75rem;
      }

      .ai-prompt-header > span {
        display: none;
      }

      #copy-button,
      .ai-panel .ai-open-button {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
        padding-top: 0.8rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
      }

      #ai-tabs .ai-tab {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.3rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="ai-page" id="ai-page">
    <div class="container-md">
      <div class="ai-hero">
        <div class="row gy-4 gx-lg-5 align-items-center">
          <div class="col-lg-7">
            <span class="ai-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i>Free prompt for ChatGPT, Gemini &amp; Claude</span>

            <h1>How to Use AI as a Language Learner</h1>

            <p class="ai-lede">If you're an A2+ language learner who wants to try using AI in your target language, you're probably wondering:</p>

            <blockquote class="call-out">What if I make a mistake? How would I even know?</blockquote>

            <p class="ai-lede mb-0">To solve this problem, I created a universal prompt that you can add to ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude. With it, the assistant doesn't just help you — it also evaluates and corrects your grammar.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-5">
            <figure class="ai-example mb-0" aria-label="Example conversation">
              <div class="ai-example-label">What it looks like</div>
              <div class="ai-bubble-user" lang="de">Ich habe gestern ins Kino gegangen. Welcher Film soll ich heute sehen?</div>
              <div class="ai-bubble-ai" lang="de">
                <h3>Ihre Grammatik</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>„Ich <strong>bin</strong> gestern ins Kino gegangen.“ – <em>gehen</em> bildet das Perfekt mit <em>sein</em>, nicht mit <em>haben</em>.</li>
                  <li>„<strong>Welchen</strong> Film soll ich heute sehen?“ – <em>Film</em> ist hier das Akkusativobjekt, deshalb <em>welchen</em>.</li>
                </ul>
                <hr />
                <h3>Die eigentliche Antwort</h3>
                <p class="mb-0">Wenn Sie Lust auf etwas Leichtes haben, empfehle ich „Good Bye, Lenin!“ – eine warmherzige Komödie über die Wendezeit in Berlin.</p>
              </div>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="ai-setup">
      <div class="container-md py-5">
        <h2 class="ai-setup-title">Set it up in 3 steps</h2>
        <p class="ai-setup-subtitle mb-0">Takes about a minute. You only need to do it once.</p>

        <ol class="ai-steps">
          <li class="ai-step">
            <p class="ai-step-title"><label for="language">Which language are you learning?</label></p>

            <select id="language" name="language" class="select-language form-select">
              {{#each htmlWebpackPlugin.options.environment.languages}}
                <option value="{{this.code}}">{{this.label}}</option>
              {{/each}}
            </select>
          </li>

          <li class="ai-step">
            <p class="ai-step-title">Copy the prompt</p>

            <div class="ai-card">
              <div class="ai-prompt-header">
                <span><i class="bi bi-file-text me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Prompt</span>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="copy-button"><i class="bi bi-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i><span data-copy-label>Copy prompt</span></button>
              </div>
              <pre class="mb-0"><code id="prompt"></code></pre>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="ai-step">
            <p class="ai-step-title">Paste it into your AI assistant's settings</p>

            <div id="ai-tabs">
              <div class="ai-tabs-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="AI assistant">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ai-tab"
                  id="ai-tab-chatgpt"
                  data-ai-tab="chatgpt"
                  aria-controls="ai-panel-chatgpt"
                  aria-selected="true"
                  translate="no"
                ><img class="ai-logo" src="assets/chatgpt.svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" width="24" height="24" />ChatGPT</button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ai-tab"
                  id="ai-tab-gemini"
                  data-ai-tab="gemini"
                  aria-controls="ai-panel-gemini"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  tabindex="-1"
                  translate="no"
                ><img class="ai-logo" src="assets/gemini.svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" width="24" height="24" />Gemini</button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ai-tab"
                  id="ai-tab-claude"
                  data-ai-tab="claude"
                  aria-controls="ai-panel-claude"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  tabindex="-1"
                  translate="no"
                ><img class="ai-logo" src="assets/claude.svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" width="24" height="24" />Claude</button>
              </div>

              <div
                class="ai-card ai-panel"
                role="tabpanel"
                id="ai-panel-chatgpt"
                data-ai-panel="chatgpt"
                aria-labelledby="ai-tab-chatgpt"
              >
                <ol>
                  <li>Open <strong translate="no">Personalization</strong> settings.</li>
                  <li>Paste the prompt into <strong translate="no">Custom instructions</strong> and save.</li>
                </ol>
                <a
                  href="https://chatgpt.com/#settings/Personalization"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class="btn btn-dark ai-open-button desktop-only"
                  translate="no"
                ><img src="assets/chatgpt.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />Open ChatGPT Personalization<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                <a
                  href="https://chatgpt.com/settings/personalization"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class="btn btn-dark ai-open-button mobile-only"
                  translate="no"
                ><img src="assets/chatgpt.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />Open in ChatGPT app</a>
                <p class="ai-panel-note mobile-only">Opens Personalization right inside the ChatGPT app. No app? It opens in your browser instead.</p>
              </div>

              <div
                class="ai-card ai-panel"
                role="tabpanel"
                id="ai-panel-gemini"
                data-ai-panel="gemini"
                aria-labelledby="ai-tab-gemini"
                hidden
              >
                <ol>
                  <li>Open <strong translate="no">Personal context</strong> and turn on <strong translate="no">Your instructions for Gemini</strong>.</li>
                  <li>Tap <strong translate="no">+ Add</strong>, paste the prompt and save.</li>
                </ol>
                <a
                  href="https://gemini.google.com/saved-info"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class="btn btn-dark ai-open-button"
                  translate="no"
                ><img src="assets/gemini.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />Open Gemini personal context<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right desktop-only" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                <p class="ai-panel-note mobile-only">The Gemini app doesn't support links to this page, so it opens in your browser. Instructions are saved to your Google account and apply in the Gemini app too.</p>
              </div>

              <div
                class="ai-card ai-panel"
                role="tabpanel"
                id="ai-panel-claude"
                data-ai-panel="claude"
                aria-labelledby="ai-tab-claude"
                hidden
              >
                <ol class="desktop-only">
                  <li>Open your <strong translate="no">Claude profile</strong> settings.</li>
                  <li>Paste the prompt into <strong translate="no">Instructions for Claude</strong> and save.</li>
                </ol>
                <ol class="mobile-only">
                  <li>Open the Claude app and go to <strong translate="no">Settings → Profile</strong>.</li>
                  <li>Paste the prompt into <strong translate="no">Instructions for Claude</strong> and save.</li>
                </ol>
                <a
                  href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class="btn btn-dark ai-open-button desktop-only"
                  translate="no"
                ><img src="assets/claude.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />Open Claude profile<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                <a
                  href="https://claude.ai/new"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class="btn btn-dark ai-open-button mobile-only"
                  translate="no"
                ><img src="assets/claude.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />Open Claude app</a>
                <p class="ai-panel-note mobile-only">Prefer the browser? <a href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-secondary">Open Claude profile settings on the web</a>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container-md py-5">
      <div class="ai-card ai-tip mb-5">
        <i class="bi bi-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
          <strong>Try it:</strong> start a new chat and write anything in <span data-language-string></span>. The reply will begin with a grammar check, then the answer.
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>Not gonna lie, it will be a bit difficult at the beginning. You will have to compose yourself to write your prompts to AI in a more-or-less sane way. But the more you do it, the better and easier it becomes.</p>

      <div class="hide-ios hide-android">
        <p>I have also created browser extensions that play out with this method extremely well.</p>

        {{> extension-buttons class="mb-4"}}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5">
        {{> social-share
          page="ai.html"
          cta="Share this method with your friends"
        }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}
